	(text "THE MEMORY CHIPS: 62256 RAM AND 27C256 EPROM OR 28C256 EEPROM, LOWER AND UPPER 32K" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0474b143-aafc-5b8f-8579-47db3f95e99b"))
	(text "IC1 / IC3: RAM / ROM in 0000-7FFF; IC11 / IC5: in 8000-FFFF. A0-A14 from the buffers and latches, data straight to\nthe bus, buffered -MRD on every !OE, buffered -MRW (WR) on the RAMs' !WE. The ROM sockets (2026-11-18) take a 27C256\nor a 28C256: JP2 (IC3) / JP1 (IC5) 1-3 + 2-4 = 27C256 (VPP on VCC, pin 27 A14); 3-5 = 28C256 (pin 1 A14), with 4-6\nthe CPU may write it (pin 27 !WE on WR); without 4-6 R7 / R6 hold !WE high. Never A14 on a 27C256's pin 1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0316ecad-adf3-5357-a86a-892d947fc333"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
